{"id":"deduction-past","lv":"b2","n":9,"cat":"modals","t":"Must have, might have, can't have: suy đoán quá khứ","en":"She must have left. · He can't have seen it.","sum":"Suy đoán về QUÁ KHỨ: must have + V3 = chắc là đã (It must have rained last night); can't / couldn't have + V3 = chắc chắn đã không (The cat can't have eaten them); might / may / could have + V3 = có thể đã (They might have missed the bus). Chuyển từ suy đoán hiện tại: must be → must have been. Phủ định dùng can't have, không dùng mustn't have. Khi nói, have đọc lướt: must've, might've. (Could have còn nghĩa “lẽ ra đã có thể” — bài should-have.)","forms":[{"f":"must have + V3 = chắc là đã","vi":"She must have left early."},{"f":"can't / couldn't have + V3 = chắc chắn đã không","vi":"He can't have seen it."},{"f":"might / may / could have + V3 = có thể đã","vi":"They might have missed the bus."},{"f":"must have → must've khi nói","vi":"You must've been tired."}],"pts":[{"id":"deduction-past","name":"Deduction: past (modal perfect)","vi":"Suy đoán quá khứ: must / might / can't have + V3"}],"cast":{"dad":{"name":{"en":"Dad","vi":"Bố"},"look":"dad","x":560},"max":{"name":{"en":"Max","vi":"Max"},"look":"boy","style":{"top":"#5DBB63","topShade":"#4AA350","collar":"#4AA350","accent":"#3E9A45","hairColor":"#C98A3C"},"x":1040}},"bg":"home-evening","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Max, the cookie jar is empty! What happened?","vi":"Max, hộp bánh quy trống trơn rồi! Chuyện gì thế?","ipa":["mæks","ðə","ˈkʊki","dʒɑɹ","ɪz","ˈɛmpti","wʌt","ˈhæpənd"],"who":"dad","ann":{"expression":"surprised"},"b":1,"start":0.454,"end":3.974,"timing":[[0,0.454],[1,0.979],[2,1.117],[3,1.429],[4,1.729],[5,1.891],[6,3.167],[7,3.466]]},{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"It wasn't me! The cat must have eaten them.","vi":"Không phải con! Chắc là con mèo ăn đấy.","ipa":["ɪt","ˈwɑzənt","mi","ðə","kæt","mʌst","hæv","ˈitən","ðɛm"],"who":"max","ann":{"expression":"shy"},"b":1,"start":4.764,"end":8.174,"timing":[[0,4.764],[1,4.881],[2,5.319],[3,